{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/[...slug]/layout,_N_T_/[...slug]/page,_N_T_/qatar"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/$c$slug/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}}}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1f0m_nyksetzr.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/02fh7_m5mrih8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1vd1qadx52uao.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-3b8en2pv9-gb8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><title>Premium LED Screens Qatar | Brightluxx Dubai UAE</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Discover top-quality LED screens in Qatar from Brightluxx Dubai. Elevate your display solutions today. Contact us for expert service in UAE &amp; Middle East.\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://brightluxx.com/qatar\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main data-testid=\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"name\": \"Premium LED Screens Qatar | Brightluxx Dubai UAE\", \"description\": \"Discover top-quality LED screens in Qatar from Brightluxx Dubai. Elevate your display solutions today. Contact us for expert service in UAE & Middle East.\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/qatar\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Premium LED Screens Qatar | Brightluxx Dubai UAE\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/qatar\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you ship LED screens to Doha, and how long does it take?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes — we ship to Qatar by road freight via Saudi Arabia or by sea/air into Hamad Port and HIA. Door-to-door delivery to Doha typically takes 1 to 3 weeks including GCC customs clearance, which we handle with our logistics partners.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you carry out site surveys and installation in Qatar?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes — our engineering team travels to Doha for site surveys, and installations are executed by our supervisors working with vetted local crews. Commissioning, calibration and handover training are always performed by our own engineers.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are your LED displays compatible with Qatar power standards?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"All panels are configured for Qatar's 240V/50Hz supply and KAHRAMAA requirements, with surge protection and power redundancy options for critical venues. Outdoor systems are rated for Doha's heat, humidity and dust.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you supply stadium and sports-venue LED in Qatar?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes — we supply perimeter boards, ribbon displays and giant screens with the high refresh rates (3840Hz+) required for broadcast venues, in line with the standards set during Qatar's World Cup stadium programme.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How is content managed for screens installed in Qatar?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Every installation includes a cloud CMS that schedules Arabic and English content remotely from any location, so Doha screens can be operated from Qatar or from a regional head office. We provide training and ongoing remote support.\"}}]}</script><div><h1>Premium LED Screens Qatar | Brightluxx Dubai UAE</h1><p>Discover top-quality LED screens in Qatar from Brightluxx Dubai. Elevate your display solutions today. Contact us for expert service in UAE &amp; Middle East.</p><h2>Qatar Areas We Serve</h2><ul><li><strong>West Bay</strong>: Doha's corporate core — tower lobbies, banks and hotel video walls.</li><li><strong>Lusail</strong>: New-city retail boulevards, stadium precincts and marina hospitality.</li><li><strong>The Pearl</strong>: Luxury retail and F&amp;B storefront displays.</li><li><strong>Msheireb Downtown</strong>: Smart-city digital signage and cultural installations.</li><li><strong>Doha Industrial Area</strong>: Warehousing and operations facilities — control and safety displays.</li></ul><h2>Qatar Signage Regulations &amp; Power</h2><h3>Ministry of Municipality Permit</h3><p>External advertising screens in Qatar require municipal advertising approval covering size, placement and content. We supply the technical file for your local submission.</p><h3>Ashghal Road Visibility</h3><p>Screens visible from Qatari roads must respect distraction and luminance guidance from the Public Works Authority — we fit auto-dimming sensors as standard.</p><h3>KAHRAMAA Power Compliance</h3><p>All systems are configured for Qatar's 240V/50Hz supply with surge protection sized to KAHRAMAA requirements.</p><h2>LED Display FAQs — Qatar</h2><h3>Can you ship LED screens to Doha, and how long does it take?</h3><p>Yes — we ship to Qatar by road freight via Saudi Arabia or by sea/air into Hamad Port and HIA. Door-to-door delivery to Doha typically takes 1 to 3 weeks including GCC customs clearance, which we handle with our logistics partners.</p><h3>Do you carry out site surveys and installation in Qatar?</h3><p>Yes — our engineering team travels to Doha for site surveys, and installations are executed by our supervisors working with vetted local crews. Commissioning, calibration and handover training are always performed by our own engineers.</p><h3>Are your LED displays compatible with Qatar power standards?</h3><p>All panels are configured for Qatar's 240V/50Hz supply and KAHRAMAA requirements, with surge protection and power redundancy options for critical venues. Outdoor systems are rated for Doha's heat, humidity and dust.</p><h3>Can you supply stadium and sports-venue LED in Qatar?</h3><p>Yes — we supply perimeter boards, ribbon displays and giant screens with the high refresh rates (3840Hz+) required for broadcast venues, in line with the standards set during Qatar's World Cup stadium programme.</p><h3>How is content managed for screens installed in Qatar?</h3><p>Every installation includes a cloud CMS that schedules Arabic and English content remotely from any location, so Doha screens can be operated from Qatar or from a regional head office. We provide training and ongoing remote support.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks