sSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$f\\\"}}]],\\\"$L10\\\"]}]\\n11:Tb5a,\\u003ch1\\u003ePremium LED Screens Qatar | Brightluxx Dubai UAE\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eDiscover top-quality LED screens in Qatar from Brightluxx Dubai. Elevate your display solutions today. Contact us for expert service in UAE \\u0026amp; Middle East.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eQatar Areas We Serve\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWest Bay\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Doha's corporate core — tower lobbies, banks and hotel video walls.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLusail\\u003c/strong\\u003e: New-city retail boulevards, stadium precincts and marina hospitality.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eThe Pearl\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Luxury retail and F\\u0026amp;B storefront displays.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eMsheireb Downtown\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Smart-city digital signage and cultural installations.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eDoha Industrial Area\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Warehousing and operations facilities — control and safety displays.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eQatar Signage Regulations \\u0026amp; Power\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eMinistry of Municipality Permit\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eExternal advertising screens in Qatar require municipal advertising approval covering size, placement and content. We supply the technical file for your local submission.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eAshghal Road Visibility\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eScreens visible from Qatari roads must respect distraction and luminance guidance from the Public Works Authority — we fit auto-dimming sensors as standard.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eKAHRAMAA Power Compliance\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAll systems are configured for Qatar's 240V/50Hz supply with surge protection sized to KAHRAMAA requirements.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eLED Display FAQs — Qatar\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eCan you ship LED screens to Doha, and how long does it take?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes — we ship to Qatar by road freight via Saudi Arabia or by sea/air into Hamad Port and HIA. Door-to-door delivery to Doha typically takes 1 to 3 weeks including GCC customs clearance, which we handle with our logistics partners.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eDo you carry out site surveys and installation in Qatar?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes — our engineering team travels to Doha for site surveys, and installations are executed by our supervisors working with vetted local crews. Commissioning, calibration and handover training are always performed by our own engineers.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eAre your LED displays compatible with Qatar power standards?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAll panels are configured for Qatar's 240V/50Hz supply and KAHRAMAA requirements, with surge protection and power redundancy options for critical venues. Outdoor systems are rated for Doha's heat, humidity and dust.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eCan you supply stadium and sports-venue LED in Qatar?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes — we supply perimeter boards, ribbon displays and giant screens with the high refresh rates (3840Hz+) required for broadcast venues, in line with the standards set during Qatar's World Cup stadium programme.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow is content managed for screens installed in Qatar?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eEvery installation includes a cloud CMS that schedules Arabic and English content remotely from any location, so Doha screens can be operated from Qatar or from a regional head office. We provide training and ongoing remote support.\\u003c/p\\u003e10:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$11\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Premium LED Screens Qatar | Brightluxx Dubai UAE\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Discover top-quality LED screens in Qatar from Brightluxx Dubai. Elevate your display solutions today. Contact us for expert service in UAE \\u0026 Middle East.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/qatar\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nc:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\ne:I[68027,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\",1]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n9:X\n0:{\"P\":null,\"c\":[\"\",\"qatar\"],\"q\":\"\",\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"children\":[[\"slug\",\"qatar\",\"c\",[\"products\"]],{\"children\":[\"__PA